WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.208
Step 1: Set regular delivery days and complete lead time, cutoff and arrival time for the supplier.

2
00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:13.667
Step 2: The app estimates usage from now until the following arrival using completed item usage and available sales forecast patterns.

3
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:22.667
Step 3: Estimated available stock and eligible confirmed incoming quantities reduce the recommendation. For 10 needed, 3 available and 2 incoming, the starting recommendation is 5.

4
00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:31.042
Step 4: In Stock count, enter the physical quantity to calculate the recommendation against that count. Check shortage and overdue warnings before adding it.
